      <h2 id="installing-compliance-operator-web-console_compliance-operator-installation" class="group scroll-mt-20">Installing the Compliance Operator through the web console<a href="#installing-compliance-operator-web-console_compliance-operator-installation" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">You can install the Compliance Operator through the OpenShift Container Platform web console by using the OperatorHub interface.</p>
      <p><strong>Prerequisites</strong></p>
      <ul>
