      <h2 id="installing-compliance-operator-cli_compliance-operator-installation" class="group scroll-mt-20">Installing the Compliance Operator using the CLI<a href="#installing-compliance-operator-cli_compliance-operator-installation" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
